  "description": "My Iron Lung is the third EP by the English rock band Radiohead, released on 26 September 1994 by Parlophone Records in the UK and by Capitol Records in the US. It was produced by Radiohead, John Leckie and Nigel Godrich. It comprises the single \"My Iron Lung\" and various B-sides, recorded while Radiohead were working on their second album, The Bends, released the following year.",
